<title>INDIA: TABLE-India K.G. Denim 1996/97 net up.</title>
<headline>TABLE-India K.G. Denim 1996/97 net up.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		53.41     vs     49.47</p>
<p>    Net sales	    1,109.43     vs    986.76</p>
<p>    Shr (in rupees)	  2.65     vs	2.47</p>
<p>    Other income	     8.34     vs	7.28</p>
<p>    Expenditure	    892.50     vs    800.42</p>
<p>    Interest		 117.06     vs    101.92</p>
<p>    Depreciation	    29.38     vs     27.27</p>
<p>    Tax			  nil	vs	 nil</p>
<p>Note: India's K.G. Denim Ltd is a leading denim manufacturer. The company said it has planned a 50 percent increaese in its production and turnover during 1997-98.</p>
<p>The firm said it had treated the minimum alternate tax as an advance tax after being eligible for tax credit.</p>
<p>-- Bombay equities desk +91-22-265 9000</p>
